## Immutable hashed bundles (Vite fingerprints every JS/CSS file)
/assets/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable

## Meal images — week-long browser cache
/breakfast.jpg
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=604800, stale-while-revalidate=86400
/lunch.jpg
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=604800, stale-while-revalidate=86400
/snacks.jpg
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=604800, stale-while-revalidate=86400
/dinner.jpg
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=604800, stale-while-revalidate=86400

## Icons
/favicon.svg
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=86400, stale-while-revalidate=3600
/icons.svg
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=86400, stale-while-revalidate=3600

## Service worker must never be cached — browser must always refetch it
/sw.js
  Cache-Control: no-cache, no-store, must-revalidate

## HTML shell — revalidate every time so asset hashes stay fresh
/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=0, must-revalidate
